<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Materials ups lead price by 3,000 yen.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Materials ups lead price by 3,000 yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsubishi Materials Corp said on Monday it had raised its selling price for lead by 3,000 yen to 119,000 yen per tonne, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company periodically reviews its selling prices, and changes them in line with market prices and currency rates.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-7431</p>
</text>
